This instance began with a salient 7-shaped motif recolored to 9 in the first demo, then showed a second different local recoloring (1 to 5) and a third (5 to 9) while many unrelated shapes remained untouched. The initial test guess simply recolored selected 7-motif occurrences and was wrong. These pairs do not justify extrapolating one template-copy or ray rule from their surface similarities.

